    u8_array_into_word_array_unchecked_slots_2026-11-28, P2, open, "E1003 [u8]-into-word-array rule does not cover let/return/field slots, [i64]? params, nested arrays, builtin-named trait methods or named-argument method calls", src/compiler_rust/compiler/src/hir/lower/module_lowering/function.rs, 529, NONE, 2026-11-28, 2026-11-28, true

